# The coverage matrix is compared BYTE-FOR-BYTE against `CoverageMatrix::render()` by the
# coverage-completeness gate. `render()` is `writeln!`-built (LF) and written verbatim, so the
# checked-out file must keep LF on every host — this repo sets no other attributes and
# `core.autocrlf=true` is common on the Windows dev host and CI runners.
coverage-matrix.md text eol=lf
